---
import styles from "./styles.module.css";
import clinic from "./clinic.module.css";
import drRobert from "./drRoberts.module.css";

const { className } = Astro.props;
---

<section class={`${className} ${styles.section}`}>
	<div class={clinic.container}>
		<div class={clinic.content}>
			<div class={clinic.heading}>
				<h2 class={clinic.headingTitle}>About Us</h2>
			</div>
			<div class={clinic.textContainer}>
				<p>
					Established in 2009, our ophthalmology clinic has proudly served patients across
					the five boroughs. We are dedicated to delivering high-quality, personalized eye
					care with a deep understanding of the community we serve.
				</p>
				<p>
					Our team is fluent in Chinese and English, allowing us to communicate clearly
					and comfortably with a diverse patient base. While we primarily serve the Asian
					community, we welcome patients from all backgrounds and are committed to
					providing attentive, culturally sensitive care to everyone who walks through our
					doors.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class={clinic.stats}>
			<div class={`${clinic.stats__card}`}>
				<span class={clinic.stats__value}>2</span>
				<span class={clinic.stats__label}> Locations </span>
			</div>
			<div class={`${clinic.stats__card}`}>
				<span class={clinic.stats__value}>5</span>
				<span class={clinic.stats__label}> Expert Doctors </span>
			</div>
			<div class={`${clinic.stats__card}`}>
				<span class={clinic.stats__label}>Open Since </span>
				<span class={clinic.stats__value}> 2009 </span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class={drRobert.container}>
		<div class={drRobert.portraitFrame}>
			<div class={drRobert.portraitWrapper}>
				<img
					src="/profileBJR.png"
					alt="Dr. BingJing Z. Roberts, Board-Certified Ophthalmologist"
					class={drRobert.portrait}
				/>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class={drRobert.biography}>
			<div class={drRobert.header}>
				<h2 class={drRobert.doctorName}>BingJing Z. Roberts, M.D.</h2>
				<span class={drRobert.doctorTitle}> Board-Certified Ophthalmologist </span>
			</div>
			<p>
				Dr. BingJing Z. Roberts is a board-certified ophthalmologist with over 20 years of
				clinical experience. She received her medical degree from the University of Maryland
				School of Medicine and completed her residency in ophthalmology at Montefiore
				Medical Center. She specializes in treating complex eye conditions such as
				cataracts, glaucoma, and retinal diseases, and performs advanced surgeries including
				laser retina surgery and lens replacement.
			</p>
			<p>
				She also serves on the board of directors of the Coalition of Asian-American
				Independent Practice Association (CAIPA).
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
